    (history ("codex" "2026-09-21" "Obsidian Index; original E minor glass-and-frame-drum theme for Pyramid Solitaire; 84 BPM.") ("codex" "2026-09-21" "Calm orders 0-3; transition 4; focused tense 5-8; B05 repeats tense. Eight-bar phrase variants and a four-bar transition.") ("codex" "2026-09-21" "Straight sixteenth onsets and eighth-grid melodies; unchanged tempo throughout. Fills use the main kit, with a final-beat breath and no noise swell.") ("codex" "2026-09-21" "Low frame taps, triangle bass, sustained minor-seventh/open-major-seventh voicings and an unfolding glass melody. Focused section adds low pulses and lower-register answers without replacing the lead.") ("codex" "2026-09-21" "Game-owned first audition. Full arrangement includes the transition; standalone calm and tense loops derive through render.py. Album arrangements remain a separate planned pass.") ("codex" "2026-09-21" "Separate identity rework; retain Obsidian Index I and all accepted tracks. 84 BPM E minor; same 32 calm / 4 transition / 32 tense bars and B05 loop.") ("codex" "2026-09-21" "New E-B rising-leap theme and four complete phrase variants. Long E pedal under Em7 and C/G/B; 3+3+2, 3+2+1+2, 3+2+2+1 and 4+2+1+1 harmonic pacing. Suspended B/E/A voicing, inversions and tonic returns replace the transposed Quiet Array progression.") ("codex" "2026-09-21" "Two-bar pitched frame-drum phrase: first-bar 12/24, answer-bar 16/28. Focused bass subdivision and quiet lower counterline; main pad, glass, bass and kit patches preserved. Same-kit transition, no noise swell, eighth-grid melody and sixteenth-grid percussion."))
